WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Search for your school or enter its Moodle site URL. Confirm the site before continuing; the app will contact it to find the sign-in method.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Confirm the school before continuing to sign in. This example uses a test school.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Open the course’s Deadlines tab for overdue and later work. Use the reminder control on a deadline to choose a reminder time. Always confirm the school’s date.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose the chat button at the bottom right. If no AI is connected, open Settings → Providers first. Connecting can send course context to that provider.
